description.narrative:
Main objectives of the assignment are:
-	Investigate the reasons of (potential) platform members to participate in platform meetings;
-	Define the focus and scope of a Horticulture Business Platform , including geographic scope, frequency, commodities and value-chain segments;
-	Come up with a strategy and road map for the establishment of a Horticulture Business Platform that takes into account aspects of membership, financial sustainability, prioritized activities and key performance indicators (KPIs).
